widening only. In codex-rs/exec-server/src/no_follow/unix.rs:220/221/228/229
and :313/314/320, rustix Stat.st_mode is u32 on armv7 Android, while libc's
mode_t/S_IF* constants are u16. u32::from preserves every bit, also on hosts
where these constants already are u32. Keep the mask, comparison operands,
symlink rejection, directory/regular-file decisions and removal unchanged.
No narrowing, branch, cfg, feature, dependency or syscall changes.

